== Erlang: what does the parser hand the compiler for  -5  in a guard and in a pattern?
guard AST      : {op,1,'>=',{var,1,'X'},{op,1,'-',{integer,1,5}}}
pattern AST    : {op,1,'-',{integer,1,5}}
2 + 3 AST     : {op,1,'>=',{var,1,'X'},{op,1,'+',{integer,1,2},{integer,1,3}}}
   -> the parser leaves {op,_,"-",{integer,_,5}} unfolded in BOTH positions; folding is a later pass.
